{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Kane Parsons (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kane_Parsons\" title=\"Kane Parsons\">Kane Parsons</a></b>  <i>(pictured)</i> became the youngest director to have a film open at the top of the North American box office?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kane_Parsons","retrieved":1787637503892},{"title":"a planned playground (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Moses\" title=\"Robert Moses\">Robert Moses</a> defended the site of <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L/CPL_Thomas_P._Noonan_Jr._Playground\" title=\"L/CPL Thomas P. Noonan Jr. Playground\">a planned playground</a></b> after local civic workers complained that the location was too rocky?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/L/CPL_Thomas_P._Noonan_Jr._Playground","retrieved":1787637503894},{"title":"The 20/20 Experience (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the songs on <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_20/20_Experience\" title=\"The 20/20 Experience\">The 20/20 Experience</a></b></i> use different metaphors for sex, including drugs, candy, and outer space?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_20/20_Experience","retrieved":1787637503897},{"title":"Laura F. Edwards (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that historian <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laura_F._Edwards\" title=\"Laura F. Edwards\">Laura F. Edwards</a></b> attended a music school that she said \"actually diverted [her] away from music\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laura_F._Edwards","retrieved":1787637503899},{"title":"a miniature golf chain (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paradise_Island_Adventure_Golf\" title=\"Paradise Island Adventure Golf\">a miniature golf chain</a></b> is an affiliate member of both England and Scotland's national governing bodies for golf?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paradise_Island_Adventure_Golf","retrieved":1787637503901},{"title":"Rose Njeri (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Kenyan coder <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rose_Njeri\" title=\"Rose Njeri\">Rose Njeri</a></b> was arrested for creating a tool to help citizens voice their opposition to a change in tax laws?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rose_Njeri","retrieved":1787637503902},{"title":"Manuscript Hamilton 254 (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manuscript_Hamilton_254\" title=\"Manuscript Hamilton 254\">Manuscript Hamilton<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>254</a></b> contains the oldest known extant drawing of the Parthenon?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manuscript_Hamilton_254","retrieved":1787637503904},{"title":"Janielle Josephs (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Jamaican runner <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janielle_Josephs\" title=\"Janielle Josephs\">Janielle Josephs</a></b> took up athletics in part because she \"wanted to miss school\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Janielle_Josephs","retrieved":1787637503906},{"title":"one of Norman Rockwell's most famous paintings (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the police officer and the young boy who modeled for <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Runaway_(painting)\" title=\"The Runaway (painting)\">one of Norman Rockwell's most famous paintings</a></b> became lifelong friends?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Runaway_(painting)","retrieved":1787637503907},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\